It asks Shodan what it knows of the public addresses the user watches: through
Shodan InternetDB (https://internetdb.shodan.io, no key, free for
non-commercial use), or through the Shodan API (https://developer.shodan.io/api)
with the API key of the user's own Shodan account. It never scans anything
itself. This integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Shodan.
Shodan is a trademark of its owner. The endpoints and fields follow the
published API documentation and the answers of the live services.
